#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/settings.rs:196
msgid "Older versions named profiles after the game's title, which falcond can never match, and stored settings falcond ignores. Fixing renames each one to the game's real process and keeps only falcond's settings. Every profile is backed up first to ~/.local/state/bigame-mode. falcond's own profiles are never touched."
